  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Zero-Dependency Configuration: Completely removed \"DotNetEnv\" dependency; implemented a high-performance, native .env parser using ReadOnlySpan and attribute-based discovery (ConfigAttribute) to populate static properties from default paths (\".env\" or \"assets/config/.env\") with automatic fallback to in-code defaults.\n      - Architectural Decoupling: Standardized ConfigAttribute and ConsoleCommandAttribute to strictly target static members; this ensures assembly-wide discovery and execution without instance overhead, fostering a cleaner, independent, and highly maintainable codebase.\n      - Contract-Driven Environment: Optimized the configuration engine to treat attributes as strict contracts, enabling seamless environment overrides without source code modifications, while ensuring the host remains robust even in the absence of external configuration files.",
